siderius-runtime-compat

Frozen adaptive-verifier and steady-state sources originate from the SIDERIUS
project, maintained by its contributors. Exact original Git revisions, source
paths and hashes are recorded in src/siderius_runtime_compat/source-inventory.json.
The sole source relocation changes the adaptive modules' steady-state import
so each profile uses its frozen detector. No numerical or stopping algorithm
is modified in those frozen files. These sources are distributed under the
repository's MIT license. Original source comments and attributions are retained.
